/1F9QIWFZe_anqyZ7cDERxXWj2E-o8cpW-?usp=drive_link", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@shinabitashina/works/371", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/a2f789ab/uploads/origins/9af8044d-9a1f-42ad-939d-b088aeaac7fd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a2a71e61c4849330ec51f435eac41d0e", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a2f789ab/uploads/origins/9af8044d-9a1f-42ad-939d-b088aeaac7fd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a2a71e61c4849330ec51f435eac41d0e, https://si.imgix.net/a2f789ab/uploads/origins/9af8044d-9a1f-42ad-939d-b088aeaac7fd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8b70e961517ef88c8748d4888218b0e9 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a2f789ab/uploads/origins/9af8044d-9a1f-42ad-939d-b088aeaac7fd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ba0e05d510ee23f541cb1b534a93142d 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hi!\nI wanna request a picture for my original character!\nThe woman is an unknown writer. In order to gain fame, she wrote a song story with the brown-haired man as the protagonist. In the book, he is a deranged murderer. However, he suddenly appeared in her real life, showing great affection toward her. The red-haired man is the writer’s neighbor and also her secret crush. He works as a singer at a bar.\nI wanna see them in British-style clothing.\nEnjoy your day!\n\nhttps://x.com/zilabarnes/status/1993236406873833742?s=46&t=i1vts8ANiKqdqrMzQbkvig", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@shinabitashina/works/370", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/dea298a8/uploads/origins/304e7c37-1509-48f8-b0d7-f28374b4eb49?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1148ef2c441b6e78d9bd064115f83326", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/dea298a8/uploads/origins/304e7c37-1509-48f8-b0d7-f28374b4eb49?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=2